# 通用短版 .gitignore(init.sh 鋪出時會改名為 .gitignore)。
# stack-specific 的規則(例:*.pyc、.next/、target/)由 scaffolder 或 AI 依專案補上。

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors(.vscode/ 不 ignore,常有共享設定)
.idea/
*.swp

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# 常見依賴/build 產物
node_modules/
dist/
build/
__pycache__/
.venv/

# Logs
*.log

# Claude Code runtime state. `.claude/` itself IS tracked on purpose:
# kit-owned files are regenerable via `init.sh --update`, but settings.json
# (accumulated permission approvals) and protected-paths (project no-touch
# zones) are project truth that nothing can rebuild. Only machine-local
# state is excluded.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Windows download marker
*:Zone.Identifier
.al

# Local agent scratch (plans in flight, prototypes)
.superpowers/

# Personal project manifest, read locally by `proj`
PROJECT.toml
RepoBox 規格文件.md

# --- Local-only dev artifacts (same block in every repo, public or private) ---
# Agent harness state and per-machine settings
.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
# Personal project manifest and lessons log: never committed
PROJECT.toml
docs/LESSONS.md
# AI implementation plans: scratch, deleted when done
docs/plans/
docs/superpowers/plans/
